<%# Draw-correction controls for a bracket-only round-1 encounter: swap a
    slot's occupant with any other round-1 occupant. This is the keyboard and
    touch path; the tree's drag grips are the primary one.

    Turbo handles the submit (it used to be data-turbo="false") so that
    data-turbo-confirm can prompt, and data-turbo-frame="_top" breaks it out of
    the encounter panel frame — the redirect still lands on the whole category
    page with the flash above the updated bracket, exactly as before.

    The prompt used to be unconditional, and the form forced past the server's
    own check, because the partner encounter is only known once a team is
    picked. It now travels with the options: the server answers per candidate
    (EncounterTeamSwap#confirmation_for) and swap_confirm_controller moves the
    selected one onto the form, so picking a partner that costs nothing asks
    nothing — and does not force either.

    Those verdicts are read at render, so the wrapper below carries a stable id
    and Admin::BaseController#respond_with_encounter re-renders it alongside the
    panel. Without that the form is a SIBLING of the panel the lineup edit
    morphs, and entering a lineup and then swapping — this feature's own flow —
    would submit a verdict taken before the lineup existed. The wrapper renders
    even when there is nothing to swap, so the stream always has a target. %>
<%= tag.div id: dom_id(encounter, :swap_team) do %>
  <%# bracket_frozen? is checked here as well as in
      EncounterTreeComponent#swappable_slots: this page builds its own slot
      list, so neutralising the tree alone would leave these forms standing. %>
  <% if encounter.pool_number.blank? && encounter.round == 1 &&
       encounter.team_category.bracket_only? && !encounter.team_category.bracket_frozen? %>
    <% swap = EncounterTeamSwap.new(encounter) # rubocop:disable Lint/UselessAssignment %>
    <% swappable_slots = [1, 2].select { |slot| swap.swappable?(slot) } # rubocop:disable Lint/UselessAssignment %>
    <% if swappable_slots.any? %>
      <% options = swap.candidates.map { |team| [team.name, team.id, {data: {confirm_message: swap.confirmation_for(team)}}] } # rubocop:disable Lint/UselessAssignment %>
      <div class="swap-team">
        <% swappable_slots.each do |slot| %>
          <% current = encounter.public_send(:"team_#{slot}") # rubocop:disable Lint/UselessAssignment %>
          <%= form_with url: admin_team_category_encounter_team_swap_path(encounter.team_category, encounter),
                method: :post, class: "swap-team__form swap-team__form--slot_#{slot}",
                data: {turbo_frame: "_top", controller: "swap-confirm"} do |f| %>
            <%= f.hidden_field :slot, value: slot %>
            <%= f.hidden_field :force, value: false, data: {swap_confirm_target: "force"} %>
            <%= label_tag "team_id_#{slot}", "Swap #{current.name} with", class: "swap-team__label" %>
            <%= select_tag :team_id, options_for_select(options),
                  include_blank: true, id: "team_id_#{slot}", required: true, class: "swap-team__select",
                  data: {swap_confirm_target: "select", action: "change->swap-confirm#update"} %>
            <%= f.submit "Swap", class: "swap-team__submit" %>
          <% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
